WEBVTT

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:04.830
Rygart!

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:11.920
Zess?

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:14.420
Hey Zess!

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:15.830
Zess!

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.790
<i>Enemy reinforcements...</i>

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:29.410
Cleo, this is your final order!

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:32.590
You're to retreat to the border alone.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.340
That's an order from your superior, got it?

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.330
Get going, Cleo!

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:39.690
Cleo!

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.020
<i>Everyone's been killed...</i>

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:46.580
<i>Lee, Argath, everyone from Irios...</i>

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:49.430
<i>They've all died at the hands of the Black Golem!</i>

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.060
Cleo, are you listening? I said retreat!

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:54.770
I won't!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:56.740
Cleo!

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:18.160
You son of a...

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:42.190
Two hostiles sighted! Two units down!

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:43.400
One is the Delphine!

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:46.280
Watch your fire! Make sure you don't hit Rygart!

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:49.990
Erekt, I'll draw their attention.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.830
Take the opportunity to get Captain Zess out!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.250
I can't do something so delicate.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.280
Please...

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.090
There's no way it could go that
smoothly in this kind of situation!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.680
And besides, what's gonna happen to you?!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.830
You damn idiot!

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.820
Target sighted! Fire!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.300
A pressure gun?

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.900
Shit! Left side, don't break formation!

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.490
T-This guy's insane!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:28.480
Captain...

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.540
<i>I have to remove the armor carefully,</i>

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.360
<i>or else the Captain will get crushed!</i>

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:50.020
<i>He's still alive!</i>

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.740
General, please get back—

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:26.350
I can't believe you're all panicking over a single unit...

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:38.140
Cleo!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.030
Erekt!

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.800
I've recovered the Captain! Let's get out of here!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:44.460
Roger!

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.110
Let us handle this, General!

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:48.010
You aren't going anywhere!

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:54.940
Chase them down! Don't just rely on your guns!

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:57.360
Fly, Artemis!

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:02.070
Shit! This thing's range is ridiculous!

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.020
Keep firing!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.360
Great job, Cleo! Put some distance between them!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.160
General Baldr, it's almost out of range!

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.360
You damned fool!

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.200
Erekt!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:25.860
Cleo!

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.040
We made it!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.100
Don't underestimate General True's troops!

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:35.000
Another unit?!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.740
Erekt...

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.790
Go on without me.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:47.100
Please... save Captain Zess.

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:51.200
Forgive me, Cleo!

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.390
What happened to Zess?

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:27.560
Fortunately for you at least, he made a dashing retreat.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.050
I see.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.980
It's finally over.

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:36.850
Right now, the National Defense Force
is fighting off Athens' main forces.

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:40.760
And even if they can repel them, General Borcuse is on his way.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:43.570
Rygart...

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:49.360
It's only just begun.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.310
Come on, start walking!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.330
Rygart!

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:29.600
Are you sure you don't need to rest?

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:30.750
I'm okay.

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.950
I just have a killer headache, that's all.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.280
<i>He's the Black Golem's pilot...</i>

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:40.880
<i>The one who injured Captain Zess, and killed Lee and Argath.</i>

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:46.230
You filthy savages!

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:49.920
I'd rather die than be humiliated!

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:55.690
You barbarians!

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:06.530
110... 111!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:09.420
Wow, they just keep coming!

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:23.110
To our people, we're on a mission to punish the puny,
conniving nation that's hiding behind Orlando.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:26.240
Is that truly how other nations see us, General?

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.910
Are you having some personal doubts about this conflict, sir?

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:34.900
If you consider international affairs as personal, then yes.

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:42.580
I haven't made this public, but our
quartz mines are beginning to run dry.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.060
Even counting our emergency reserves,
we've probably got another ten years.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:49.190
We've got to find more abundant lands no matter what the price.

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:55.470
This is the only option we have left...

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:01.500
At the risk of sounding arrogant, I support the invasion.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:07.860
Since their country's defeat at Assam,
Orlando's pacifist faction has gained significant influence.

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:10.430
Because of that, I highly doubt they'll get involved.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:15.850
This kind of opportunity comes only once every 50 years.

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:22.450
I trust you, the man willing to play the villain
for his country's sake, more than anyone.

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:29.030
Athens' future is in your hands, General Borcuse!

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:36.610
Fight for your friends, your family,
and the very peace of this continent!

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:39.140
All forces, move out!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:47.090
Heavy Knight 1st Class Narvi, you played
a major part in the prisoner's capture.

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:48.400
I'd like to hear your thoughts on this.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:55.730
With all due respect, General Baldr, our squad contributed absolutely nothing to the capture.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:12:01.910
To take credit for doing so would be to
disgrace the reputation of this nation's Knights.

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:06.440
Thus, I feel that I am not qualified
to participate in this discussion.

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:09.060
Well said, Narvi!

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.130
Spoken like a true knight of this kingdom!

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:14.840
Therefore, we shall excuse
ourselves from this meeting!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.330
Let's go, Narvi!

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.250
Sir!

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.340
Getting information out of the
prisoner is of the utmost importance.

00:12:27.340 --> 00:12:31.320
However, at the same time, we must exercise
extreme caution when dealing with her.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:36.680
Rygart, your input is very important as well.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:39.220
Rygart!

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.170
Yes?

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:41.560
What should we do with our prisoner?

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.060
Why not just release her to Athens?

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:45.580
Indeed...

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.100
Pardon me, General.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:53.620
There's a chance she may commit suicide.
Would you please let me handle this matter?

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:57.510
She may prove useful in refitting the new Golem.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:12:59.930
Please, sir.

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:19.290
So you want me to master this thing in a week, huh?

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:27.710
W-What do you say? The only person capable of
piloting it besides yourself would be Lady Narvi.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.740
Get rid of these shackles and I'll pilot whatever you want me to.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:33.630
It sure feels nice to be relied upon.

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:38.350
A new squad centered around the Delphine is being formed.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:42.570
It's been suggested that you enter
under the command of their captain.

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:50.030
I might lose my temper and
accidentally shoot my comrades.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:51.890
You mind?

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.810
<i>No matter what they do to me, I won't say a thing.</i>

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:07.450
<i>If it comes down to it, I'll just smash
my head into the walls until I die.</i>

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:20.960
Please... Come inside.

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:28.990
<i>This is the torture chamber?</i>

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.230
These are my private quarters.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:34.280
It's a little messy, but please bear with it.

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:35.440
<i>A little?</i>

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:40.430
I am the wife of Krisna's king, Sigyn.

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:41.360
What's your name?

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:42.680
Cleo.

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:46.000
<i>Damn! I told her my name!</i>

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:51.200
<i>The king's wife... That makes her the queen!</i>

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.120
Cleo Saubraffe.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.720
This is the crest of the famous House Saubraffe, yes?

00:14:56.720 --> 00:15:00.420
We didn't find anything suspicious,
so I was permitted to return it to you.

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:09.590
I can tell that you treasure it dearly.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:17.340
<i>She's so beautiful... and gentle.</i>

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.930
<i>Not at all like a barbarian princess.</i>

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:24.140
<i>But I'm still an enemy soldier.</i>

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:26.280
<i>I won't be fooled so easily!</i>

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.980
I'll pour us some tea.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:32.190
I don't know what you're up to,
but I'm not going to tell you anything.

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:35.650
Cleo, you're welcome to stay here in this room.

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:38.980
Of course, I cannot allow you to leave.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:46.930
I would also like to have a private discussion
regarding things like Zess and your new golems.

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:52.350
I intend to treat you as a guest as long as you stay here.
You'll be fine even if you don't wish to speak.

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:56.560
You're being quite soft on me...

00:15:57.230 --> 00:16:00.610
The Krisnan forces are not
used to dealing with prisoners.

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:05.690
Now then, I'll begin the questioning.

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:10.130
You singlehandedly brought down an estimated five golems.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:13.680
Yet miraculously, none of the pilots were killed.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:18.180
Did you purposely avoid killing them?

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:22.130
If such sophisticated maneuvers are
possible with a golem as complex as yours,

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:25.300
then you must be an extremely capable sorcerer.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:34.630
But I wonder... Does that make you a model soldier?

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.070
There you go.

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:51.960
<i>What's wrong with her?</i>

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:54.290
<i>She's an adult, yet she's so frail...</i>

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.420
<i>I can't believe there's someone weaker than me!</i>

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.340
Don't move!

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:08.210
You've shown me great kindness, but unfortunately...

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.390
Stand up.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:16.930
Remove your garments too.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:20.260
I told you to disrobe.

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.030
C'mon, eat it!

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:26.100
What's the matter? Eat!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.520
What's your problem? Just eat your food.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:34.810
Whoa, I see your proud animal
spirit hasn't been completely broken!

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.840
Hey! Where ya goin'?

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:43.020
He'll come back when he gets tired.

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:46.040
You mean when he gets hungry.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:55.960
Rygart.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:57.090
Yeah?

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:00.530
That prisoner girl... Apparently she's only 12.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:02.360
12 years old?!

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.300
Well... yeah.

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:06.910
<i>What's with that body of hers?</i>

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:11.590
<i>Is she seriously 12 years old? No way!</i>

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:12.600
<i>That's ridiculous.</i>

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.540
<i>What did Athens do to her body?</i>

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:28.110
Sorry, man.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:28.910
Hm?

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:31.460
I dropped Gram's food.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:32.840
Don't worry about it.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:34.550
Goodnight.

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:46.640
Call the guards inside without making a fuss.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:56.200
Do you really think you can
escape to the border by yourself?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.410
Don't talk.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.060
<i>That's the Black Golem's pilot...</i>

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:23.550
Cleo...

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:30.310
Hey man, what're you tryin' to pull?

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.750
You're a little heavy, you stupid bird!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:36.060
How about you get the hell off?!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.310
What's your deal?!

00:19:41.310 --> 00:19:44.160
Try that again and I'll break your damn wings!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.760
You've really put on weight, pal.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:00.190
I guess "grown" would be a nicer way to put it...

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:03.350
Do you remember when you were a little squirt?

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:08.430
Well, a birdbrain like you probably can't remember.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.370
I used to take care of you all the time.

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:13.620
So did Zess.

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:18.160
Old Captain Serious, Zess, used to help out a lot.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:23.530
At first, he was so clumsy that he nearly dropped his poker face.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:27.180
But he was the first who offered to care for you.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:32.510
Do you still remember him?

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:36.780
He used to show off and let you perch on his shoulder.

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.410
Man, I nearly cracked up.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.720
But then again, everyone was too scared to actually laugh at him.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:47.240
'Cause there was nobody tough enough to beat him.

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:54.850
Zess can't possibly lose...

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:02.270
Maybe... if he had taken you home with him...

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:07.030
Agh, why am I spilling my guts to a dumb bird?

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:09.630
Why did Zess...

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:24.800
Hey, you're—

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:26.010
What?!

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:27.850
There aren't any rounds...

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:30.240
It's empty...

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:31.260
Freeze!

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:34.140
Forgive me, Cleo.

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:39.970
I'm terrified of guns. I can't even shoot one.

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:51.250
I thought it was strange that
I was able to take your gun so easily.

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:54.000
You went easy on me, didn't you?

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:54.890
Walk.

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:07.160
Ow! You little—

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:15.350
I did try to fight you off, though.

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:19.990
Your claws are digging into me, you little bastard!

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:53.620
It appears everyone dislikes you.

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:55.760
You're insane as everyone has mentioned you to be.

00:23:56.190 --> 00:23:59.020
Night before, eve of the sortie.
